# PUSH_CODE_BINARY_RESPONSE (0x8C) to a REQ_TYPE_GET_TELEMETRY_DATA: reserved, tag[4], LPP. The
# same LPP bytes as telemetry-response; what differs is that this frame is matched by tag rather
# than by pubkey prefix, which is why the prefix is not in it.
